UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Per NIST IR 8214 Rev. 1, secure multiparty computation enables multiple parties to jointly compute functions over their combined inputs without revealing individual datasets. SMPC provides cryptographic guarantees that no party learns anything beyond the agreed-upon output, making it superior to approaches requiring data disclosure.
